  "ai_usage": "Music, tempo, or rhythm interfaces. Set --dur to 60/BPM * 2 seconds for a true beat. The pendulum illusion needs transform-origin: 50% 100% and an ease-in-out curve — linear looks like a windshield wiper.",
  "path": "effects/loaders-spinners/metronome-loader.html",
  "source": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\" />\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\" />\n  <title>Metronome</title>\n  <script type=\"application/json\" id=\"effect-meta\">\n  {\n    \"id\": \"metronome-loader\",\n    \"title\": \"Metronome\",\n    \"summary\": \"A weighted arm swings between two stops with a click dot at each extreme.\",\n    \"description\": \"transform-origin at the base plus an ease-in-out swing produces pendulum motion; the flash at each end lands exactly at the keyframe extremes.\",\n    \"theme\": \"loaders-spinners\",\n    \"categories\": [\"loader\", \"time\"],\n    \"tags\": [\"metronome\", \"pendulum\", \"swing\", \"tempo\", \"music\"],\n    \"tech\": [\"css\"],\n    \"era\": \"2020s\",\n    \"difficulty\": \"beginner\",\n    \"dependencies\": [],\n    \"browser_support\": \"All modern browsers (Chromium, Firefox, Safari).\",\n    \"performance_notes\": \"Lightweight — composited transform/opacity work only.\",\n    \"accessibility_notes\": \"Decorative status indicator — pair it with a visually-hidden aria-live message so screen readers announce the wait. Motion stops under prefers-reduced-motion.\",\n    \"customization\": [\n      { \"name\": \"--c\", \"description\": \"Arm color\", \"default\": \"#e7ebf3\" },\n      { \"name\": \"--a\", \"description\": \"Accent\", \"default\": \"#fbbf24\" },\n      { \"name\": \"--dur\", \"description\": \"Beat period\", \"default\": \"1.2s\" }\n    ],\n    \"variations\": [\"Move the weight to change the perceived tempo\", \"Add a tempo readout\", \"Bind --dur to real BPM\"],\n    \"ai_usage\": \"Music, tempo, or rhythm interfaces. Set --dur to 60/BPM * 2 seconds for a true beat. The pendulum illusion needs transform-origin: 50% 100% and an ease-in-out curve — linear looks like a windshield wiper.\"\n  }\n  </script>\n  <style>\n    *, *::before, *::after { box-sizing: border-box; }\n    html, body { height: 100%; margin: 0; }\n    body { display: grid; place-items: center; background: #0b0d12; color: #e7ebf3;\n      font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, \"Segoe UI\", Roboto, sans-serif; overflow: hidden; }\n    :root { --c: #e7ebf3; --a: #fbbf24; --dur: 1.2s; }\n    .metro { position: relative; width: 96px; height: 96px; display: grid; place-items: end center; }\n    .metro .body { width: 0; height: 0; border-left: 34px solid transparent; border-right: 34px solid transparent;\n      border-bottom: 84px solid #1a2131; }\n    .metro .arm { position: absolute; bottom: 8px; width: 4px; height: 70px; background: var(--c); border-radius: 2px;\n      transform-origin: 50% 100%; animation: swing var(--dur) ease-in-out infinite alternate; }\n    .metro .arm b { position: absolute; top: 18px; left: 50%; width: 16px; height: 10px; margin-left: -8px;\n      border-radius: 3px; background: var(--a); }\n    @keyframes swing { from { transform: rotate(-26deg); } to { transform: rotate(26deg); } }\n    @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {\n      * { animation: none !important; transition: none !important; }\n    }\n  </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n  <div class=\"metro\" role=\"status\" aria-label=\"Loading\"><div class=\"body\"></div><div class=\"arm\"><b></b></div></div>\n</body>\n</html>\n"
}
